    <mxCell id="legend_bg" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="925" width="1910" height="145" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_title" value="Legend &amp; Invariants" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="931" width="1882" height="22" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
    <mxCell id="legend_text" value="1. Common 7-step contract: SQS receive -&gt; idempotency lookup -&gt; guard check -&gt; read persisted input -&gt; Bedrock Converse -&gt; TransactWriteItems -&gt; delete.&lt;br/&gt;2. Failure invariance: failed invocation never alters source object or case state; DLQ retains 14 days for idempotent operator redrive.&lt;br/&gt;3. Person screening: ground station screens before upload; person_present moves to S3 restricted/ (KMS restricted, denied to all functions).&lt;br/&gt;4. Region &amp; coded scope: all storage and Bedrock Nova Pro inference run in us-east-1; inf-threshold (D10/B10) is coded in Terraform; drone functions are architecture-only.&lt;br/&gt;5. Dashed lines = error/DLQ, async plausibility, restricted quarantine, or prepared Azure target (not deployed)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="49" y="953" width="1882" height="113" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
